            "review_title": "Review at Vua Chả Cá",
            "review_text": "Siao lu H\n4 contributions\n0\nDelicious grilled fish\nNov 2024 • Friends\nSuper delicious fried fish dish 😋First dried fried fried fish, then cooked into an acidic fried fish pot, absolutely no odor or raw flavor, too stunning (originally, the impression of freshwater fish is poor), the environment is comfortable and clean, each table is accompanied by a smoking machine, the service staff is young and charming, the guests are welcome, thank you for their warm and careful service🙏\nRead more\nValue\nService\nFood\nAtmosphere\nTranslated from Chinese\nShow original\nWritten November 28, 2024",
